			],
			"Message": "style(Wind): Clean up imports and formatting in Panel, Sidebar, StatusBar, and Telemetry service layers\n\nRemove unused imports across PanelLive, SidebarLive, StatusBarLive, and TelemetryLive. Simplify Effect.Effect return type annotations to single-line format where appropriate. Reformat Option.getOrElse calls in TelemetryLive to consistent multi-line style. Condense TelemetryService.log and Effect.runSync calls to single lines for readability.\n\nImpact: Reduces import noise, improves code consistency, and eliminates dead code references without changing runtime behavior.",
			"SHA": "ee618e6691276b688f37215747b09561820ab956"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-10T12:57:03Z",
			"File": [
				"⠃⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1988,
				93
			],
			"Message": "build(Wind): Regenerate upstream service interfaces and minify ESBuild configuration\n\nRestore 44 generated service interface files under Source/Effect/Generated/ from VS Code upstream sources, adding CommandCatalog.ts with 551 command registrations and ServiceCatalog.ts with 516 service decorator entries. Minify all ESBuild configuration files (BaseConfig, CompileConfig, TargetConfig, Wind.js, index.js, and constants) to single-line compact format.\n\nRefactor PanelLive, SidebarLive, StatusBarLive, and TelemetryLive service layers to use synchronous factory pattern reading from globalThis.__CEL_SERVICES__, eliminating Effect runtime overhead during initialization. Replace HashMap.get().pipe(Effect.runSync) with Option.getOrElse for cleaner metric/span retrieval in TelemetryLive. Optimize Vine NotificationStream to use Queue.unsafeOffer instead of Effect.runFork per frame.\n\nAdd 15 Workbench*BridgeShapeGenerated.ts bridge shape files mapping upstream service interfaces to Wind's __CEL_SERVICES__ global registry, plus UserSettingsBridgeShapeGenerated.ts for configuration service bridging.\n\nImpact: Restores generated upstream interfaces deleted in previous refactor, aligns service definitions with current VS Code upstream, reduces service initialization latency, and completes bridge shape generation for all core workbench services.",
			"SHA": "dbdc27c4975e0cc2442e7765cc2a8aa26b707524"
		},
